WEBVTT

00:10:29.124 --> 00:10:31.543
We hosted a really modest holiday party

00:10:31.585 --> 00:10:34.338
at a homeless shelter for women
in Brooklyn, New York.

00:10:34.880 --> 00:10:37.299
And at this point,
we didn't have anything to give,

00:10:37.299 --> 00:10:38.926
so we gave our time.

00:10:38.967 --> 00:10:40.552
We gave our hearts,

00:10:40.552 --> 00:10:44.390
and we found a few boxes
of merchandise samples that we donated.

00:10:44.390 --> 00:10:46.475
And around that time as well,

00:10:46.517 --> 00:10:50.270
we organized a chain-wide
sales competition.

00:10:50.270 --> 00:10:52.564
The top 40 stores

00:10:52.606 --> 00:10:56.360
earned the right to donate 250 dollars

00:10:56.402 --> 00:10:58.779
to a local charity of their own choosing.

00:10:59.571 --> 00:11:01.824
Together, these two things, right,